OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start to Thursday as
OL,6,Fshowery rain, sometimes heavy with
OL,7,Fthunder and hail, moves southwards
OL,8,Facross the region. This gradually
OL,9,Fclearing to leave a brighter
OL,10,Fafternoon, with just a few lighter
OL,11,Fshowers. Feeling cool in the northerly
OL,12,Fbreeze.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers initially fading
OL,15,Fduring the evening, becoming largely
OL,16,Fdry overnight with clear spells.
OL,17,FShowers return around dawn on Friday.
OL,18,FStaying breezy along coasts. A notably
OL,19,Fchillier night than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
