OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FEarly morning showers clearing
OL,6,Fto leave a largely dry day. Although
OL,7,Frather cloudy, some bright spells
OL,8,Fcould emerge, particularly later on.
OL,9,FTemperatures below the seasonal
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FBecoming more settled with an
OL,14,Fincreasing number of sunny spells.
OL,15,FSmall chance of a shower on Saturday.
OL,16,FTemperatures below average for August
OL,17,Fbut feeling pleasant where the
OL,18,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
